# WIX -> CLOUDFLARE MIGRATION MAP
# Every path below earned Google impressions on the Wix site in the 16 months
# to 2026-07-20 and has no equivalent file in this repo. Without these rules
# each one returns 404 on cutover and Google drops the ranking it earned.
# Source: Search Console, sc-domain:3jsautobody.com. 331 URLs audited.
