# Old Wix store - 271 product pages, 380 clicks, 29,714 impressions (22% of all
# search visibility). These were Addictive Desert Designs / DV8 products which
# the new catalog does not yet carry. Pointing them at the catalog keeps
# visitors on site, but Google treats a mass redirect to a generic page as a
# soft 404 and will NOT carry these rankings over. The real fix is loading the
# ADD/DV8 product data so these can point at equivalent product pages.
/product-page/*  /parts-catalog  301

